msgstr "LMCache"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20
msgid "**A KV Cache Management Layer for Scalable LLM Inference.**"
msgstr "**用于可扩展 LLM 推理的 KV Cache 管理层。**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"We are currently in the process of upgrading our documentation to provide"
" better guidance and examples. Some sections may be under construction. "
"Thank you for your patience!"
msgstr "我们目前正在升级我们的文档，以提供更好的指导和示例。某些部分可能正在建设中。感谢您的耐心等待！"

#: ../../source/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"LMCache is a **KV cache management layer** for LLM inference. It turns KV"
" cache from a temporary state into reusable *AI-native knowledge* that "
"can be *stored* persistently, *reused* across multiple serving engines, "
"*monitored* with an observability stack, and *transformed* for better "
"generation quality. As a result, LMCache **reduces TTFT** (time-to-first-"
"token) and **improves throughput**, especially for long-context agentic, "
"multi-turn conversation, and knowledge-augmented workloads (e.g., RAG)."
msgstr "LMCache 是一个用于 LLM 推理的 **KV Cache 管理层**。它将 KV Cache 从临时状态转变为可持久存储的可重用 *AI 原生知识*，可以跨多个服务引擎 *重用*，通过可观测性栈进行 *监控*，并 *转换* 以提高生成质量。因此，LMCache **减少了 TTFT**（首次生成时间）并 **提高了吞吐量**，特别适用于长上下文代理、多轮对话和知识增强的工作负载（例如，RAG）。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"LMCache is **vendor-neutral**. It can be used as a KV cache layer for a "
"range of mainstream open-source serving engines, inference frameworks, "
"hardware vendors, storage systems, and infrastructure providers. The "
"vendor neutrality allows users to freely switch between serving engines "
"and storage vendors, while reusing the stored KV caches."
msgstr "LMCache 是 **供应商中立的**。它可以作为主流开源服务引擎、推理框架、硬件供应商、存储系统和基础设施提供商的 KV Cache 层使用。供应商中立性允许用户在服务引擎和存储供应商之间自由切换，同时重用已存储的 KV Cache。"

