#: ../../source/index.rst:49
msgid "Key features"
msgstr "关键特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Engine-independent deployment**: LMCache, as a standalone daemon "
"process, manages KV cache independently from the inference engine "
"process, so that KV cache will not be lost even if the inference engine "
"crashes (i.e., no fate-sharing with engines)."
msgstr "**引擎无关的部署**：LMCache 作为一个独立的守护进程，独立于推理引擎进程管理 KV Cache，因此即使推理引擎崩溃，KV Cache 也不会丢失（即，与引擎无共享命运）。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Persistent, tiered KV cache offloading and reuse**: Move KV caches out "
"of GPU memory into a tiered storage hierarchy spanning CPU memory, local "
"storage, and remote backends, enabling reuse across requests, sessions, "
"and engine instances to reduce repeated prefill computation and improve "
"TTFT."
msgstr "**持久化、分层的 KV Cache 卸载和重用**：将 KV Cache 从显存中移出，进入跨越 CPU 内存、本地存储和远程后端的分层存储层次结构中，实现跨请求、会话和引擎实例的重用，以减少重复的 Prefill 计算并提高 TTFT。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Production-level KV cache observability**: LMCache provides a rich set "
"of KV cache observability metrics, including typical Kubernetes metrics "
"(health monitoring, performance diagnostics), KV-cache-specific metrics "
"(request-level and token-level prefix cache hits, lifecycle, request-"
"level KV cache performance), management metrics (user-specific usage), "
"and more."
msgstr "**生产级 KV Cache 可观测性**：LMCache 提供丰富的 KV Cache 可观测性指标，包括典型的 Kubernetes 指标（健康监控、性能诊断）、KV Cache 特定指标（请求级和 token 级前缀缓存命中、生命周期、请求级 KV Cache 性能）、管理指标（用户特定使用情况）等。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Pluggable storage and transport backends**: Easily integrate remote "
"storage and KV transfer backends through a unified interface, enabling KV"
" cache offloading and sharing across storage providers. Through this "
"interface, LMCache supports storage backends including CPU RAM, local "
"disk (SSD), Redis/Valkey, Mooncake, InfiniStore, S3-compatible object "
"storage, NIXL, and GDS."
msgstr "**可插拔的存储和传输后端**：通过统一接口轻松集成远程存储和 KV 传输后端，实现 KV Cache 卸载和跨存储提供商共享。通过此接口，LMCache 支持的存储后端包括 CPU 内存、本地磁盘（SSD）、Redis/Valkey、Mooncake、InfiniStore、兼容 S3 的对象存储、NIXL 和 GDS。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Non-prefix KV reuse**: Extend KV reuse beyond prefix caching by reusing"
" cached KV blocks at any position in the prompt. This leverages "
"CacheBlend to selectively recompute tokens for quality recovery."
msgstr "**非前缀 KV 重用**：通过在提示中的任何位置重用缓存的 KV 块，将 KV 重用扩展到前缀缓存之外。这利用 CacheBlend 选择性地重计算 token 以恢复质量。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"**PD disaggregation and KV transfer**: Support KV cache transfer from "
"prefill workers to decode workers over NVLink, RDMA, or TCP through "
"transport layers such as NIXL."
msgstr "**PD 分离和 KV 传输**：支持通过 NIXL 等传输层，通过 NVLink、RDMA 或 TCP 将 KV Cache 从 Prefill 工作节点传输到解码工作节点。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Pluggable KV transformation**: A simple interface for researchers to "
"write compression, token dropping, and custom serialization through a "
"flexible SERDE interface."
msgstr "**可插拔 KV 转换**：通过灵活的 SERDE 接口，为研究人员提供编写压缩、token 丢弃和自定义序列化的简单接口。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"LMCache is becoming an integral layer in the LLM inference *ecosystem*, "
"with *community*-driven integration with serving engines, inference "
"frameworks, hardware vendors, storage systems, and infrastructure "
"providers:"
msgstr "LMCache 正逐渐成为 LLM 推理*生态系统*中的一个重要层，与*社区*驱动的服务引擎、推理框架、硬件供应商、存储系统和基础设施提供商进行集成："

